//Phase 13 Step 0 fix round coverage lock: alias as the element type of
//"new Elem[...]". The element type slot is held outside the children
//list; the alias pre-pass reaches it through the explicit NewArrayExpr
//branch. Verified working before the fix; this test pins it.
//(0.7.2: the original body stored a raw array handle into an element
